  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "行觸大諱，與司命忤。執囚束縛，拘制於吏。憂人有喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a35ab2efc61f5ae25f0ed8a20c3f61a45331e7dba98a01cc20c249e061ef05c4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c1852211a5b45baab41b2c7e27cc61dacdd7bdebe39186b17e3d67cc6931b26"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "穿胸狗邦，僵離旁舂。天地易紀，日月更始。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fca1b8dc1bb3fdead6e22b62efb36c20b55262adc54157b61bf9f6a3fcdda444",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:00ad53e596ca54112bbb93d3c0bfafc378ccee80bbe5c2eace13abbfb4395a71"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "從風縱火，荻芝俱死。三害集房，十子中傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:89b5b633bb763f946d60ce783c58666cbd4dff19e019eb3dcb45438807895201",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:858e1b50c02ad9c6c4de5159635e47127989e936f864bb41892a7628d6cadf63"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "北山有棗，橘柚所聚。荷囊載擔，香盈筐筥。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00132c0342e5487bd203eac356e72d1d8964bf7be8c613dd77a52a3dc24a2dea",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4559c22a927a6a56a16936a254c83c3d69c30a6530c9544c4302c0911bdb05c9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "金贖狸，不聽我辭。繫於虎鬚，牽不得來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:747e01a3c8357190a8736b54c2a1a2de6dd80b7cca4e3bcd41b7c320829bccc5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cb21c1d186ce16599c0c079b244aff7fa2192f2f6ca935bae2367f8d465463f4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "上下惟邪，寡婦無夫。歡心隔塞，君子離居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3522e71061c8b1110be9ed656d6530b6840ac0eafeae1d16d7ee5026b83106c5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:890b1dceb5936f3ac07fe592b19c28329527adfe28487683b1f45fa47082b882"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "二人輦車，徙去其家。并沸釜鳴，不可安居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:18b70c3e8c72303648927b8ea75bd5497dcb66dc070f4ca7f20ae113304c4a9f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22393dae440cec18c1119b5f41cb2d921f52d765129bf19df70368fd37d12b56"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "蹇驢不才，駿驥失時。筋力勞盡，罷於沙丘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:524e2e0c8ee0563128bfb0853077039eeeccaf2565fc3e4167b2c41e7a677f3c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:314110874593031829ecbb34224b139ba5e94b7ea2d4b97a935cc6e661f25400"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "明傷之初，為穆出郊。以讒復歸，名曰豎牛。剝亂叔孫，飫於空丘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:21b685fc0fe51bcaaaa1592744b2a8632f0c6c4181ae672487edff3dcacd3acc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f935d35728dbe707b12d984273e01dcfe521c5272a11ec7ea4528bda044d59e4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "天火大起，飛鳥驚駭。作事不時，為多咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4085136770171310aa3acfbe521dba105890d39fb0fa4e8d8678176b7b6848f9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a1838434a11cd60f419c993a7e9c64530d397ada0402535bcad44aa33b066c3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "土與山連，共保歲寒。終無災患，萬世長安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8afa4e1085a83c6b7fe6d5daf67832063c3cf0db62fdd0299d1308beb634c55e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:af08f0e65175abe02822b2357e0ab748acbf20deaf83340232104f538ac7fe63"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "日出阜東，山蔽其明。章甫薦履，箕子佯狂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c49cd6d58ad9b05c6fc2cdc764180c8abbc5b10b97bf2fc442caa9d802a5d0eb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:99bf4da1d6c24e30e0a6dcac1ab1429f086eac96cf730c13ac7f712d21f35203"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "龍馬上山，絕無水泉。喉焦唇乾，口不能言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e8b49aa40ab9b7ab5a2cf8739724a0ea75640ca9ab1ae821211dae9df9d9ad3d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d010ae76b76cf160d87ec34b4cdeb55162dc9588e17e638f91031de5e4f7b52"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "雄處弱水，雌在海濱。將別持食，悲哀於心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:54540d7236998e09ee72ae680771445fbf63d7477e6eae1960a7210cc5b3832e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a3140b6e1b520c94051300a0f0ce7dd9c66423744b3134eb2d97b4caf7512d7d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "庭燎夜明，追嗣日光。陽軟不至，陰雄生戾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e1d83d4ee32f2d3fcfbbd588f65c7df3ecc76c1fee8059523c841fc27c83e14c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:12cc8dacd7ddeeb1226737b1e75ead0a98200cdb4d39499c0848024850174de5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "三婦同夫，忽不相思。志恒不愁，顏色不怡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4b50c3bc25be5656eaf6221a6aa86e6195e3c6440bc8b25c266ec55dfdfdd9f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ee31145cbcb078638d473e95450c603268166bf327db5196231b9979890c6b54"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "鶴盜我珠，逃於東都。鵠怒追求，郭氏之墟。不見蹤跡，反為患災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d3fc508c17e6a729c351050ef39d0fae3cba2940aeeebc1803e5ad5fa9c0f5f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dc2dac116fd11d56d1356af78bd50e259d9ebc9ec0699a339e72b456f1f636d1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "沐猴冠帶，盜在非位。眾犬共吠，倉狂蹶足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:044bb42f100baff40c3b5c4c2b0fb698a5c78a032df5f45fd56869aa007a292c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:84b9c5fa991ef315fbb2be4c6917472e398c5a9837cfc02b7e312aa226260cc6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "黍稷禾稻，垂畝方好。中旱不雨，傷風病稿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:df76d81eb28a4a92ce2bd9b76403ab72d66888d2c36103a188c44cd6ed3a78a1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eec89105a10d9adbcd0b5554baedf87ebd41e4d3515e8e353f2c07d5c2f3e828"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "雄聖伏名，人匿麟遠。走鳳飛北，亂禍未息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d2c9828e100aa038bdf6afde307183696be1e3aeae34236582e7f7fb31dae17f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dcbf35a0821e245073497d7bde81590e19ab8dc3562b0a60cc38294e9a931239"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "三母多福，天祿所伏。居之寵光，君子有福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ad696a2be56314f826688f092255ac3c37488f92f3ce071d473f8354ced04a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c9f4e71f6d9cee110feb5d5ad85a28656a90ee607acdde7066f04bde82955f5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "被服文德，升入大麓。四門雍肅，登受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b8512250e04c765ccf2de56afdd0c25c523d554f3cefa7149986552f35d8db24",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5ddf55085aa098a0cd6217e5916e0971079bc4706b336917ae8767e7f898e5bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "褰裳涉河，水流漬衣。幸賴舟子，濟脫無他。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6bc1352f9d0665bc1a7e037a63926affe43b7fa3bbba97114527f9a6bfdd013f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fafc6184a58a0abd9f06297fcd18fc963b8e6e05a55ebbd1cc94f5c87276d841"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "班馬還師，以息勞疲。役夫嘉喜，入戶見妻。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f653b0d821a374f738ad853f11bdafb93047dfe82fed143d56d062476b2e318",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f1c16fb5df12d08f975dc6f7934abc2d5dfd627c93027840856ae9dc8f72d4e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "東鄰嫁女，為王妃后。莊公築館，以尊王母。歸于京師，季姜悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fcee32674ed3d626d09c9306803e3adf8eea0104e7d7fe382221f3ffeda403a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:241226f8e0f78b794ae094873df4355610b4a5df8c31d400b46b874f5ee63484"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "百足俱行，相輔為強。三聖翼事，王室寵光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b33073ed54f77fabb82913a90f31b70e85fa7c2bd7d4a147f14d8dea815cb31",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4221fcdd64d0e99b6d7af72fc92693523f255bc3f6c2f33822107d65a86a5469"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "危坐至暮，請求不得。膏澤不降，政戾民忒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:738414c122f677a263cdeb0ddd6389e57d59c986d5ef81f96f686bc0c1c67d1e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8200b9e50bb983af57e9468fda7a807c9b62322d01aad0879b60362a5bf74c8b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "百川朝海，泛流不止。路雖遼遠，無不到者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:27c85d1989a6c25f49729bd105ab89931bb7bddf0f73d59b71663ab384ab43d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e65829e14043dc4e96f49b2b91b119f4f9f4f053c993607250c21d65b8061161"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "乘騮駕驪，東至於濟。遭遇仁友，送我以資。厚得利歸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ffc376dc60e79018932175bb58db64ef51cf0fd629bd03e3258669ad35482839",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9f5b85b7af9d08c0528ef55c229d41dffe6d8055898632025a43be142c149384"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "禮壞樂崩，陰請不當。成子傲慢，為簡生殃。欲求致理，力疲心爛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1012010dd026a532f8a8b2a32e2ff2447b4a703d6c36d1506bffd95ab9675e0a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6529d6447da28c309b68c455af4b3d402e9436f9a2acef20111df471d45727b5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "一人輦車，乘入虎家。王母貪饕，盜我犁牛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5e74872c2d0e03788ac2530e6cde5e6d9117c45b9167cca7801f5988a2d638f4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e2427c5a8133cdb2cd7ef163df2094adfa0af7dd7aabd544063c724fe0550fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "羊頭兔足，少肉不飽。漏囊敗粟，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2db6ecc5d3594fa77eef5dfb9a9a74142d8205b6765449b51730da285bb14e8d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ccd3b84e60064ae1474ccfe90e23ad1c0b8fce5ec2f4f11f58ae9fa6e26eca4e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "新田宜粟，上農得穀。君子懷德，以千百福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7ed5e6bb6bb460d2ecd79098b6f45371071931aacf9c88ad63e7fba6b5e485fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e582f50334ed7ab01d6a28077dd70deadd4eec3ce0919994ee1ba31307ae1a0e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "夷羿所射，發輒有獲。雙鳧俱得，利伐王國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db818557c30eb361e8824e83265eb63cdc9521b4fa19f0e03275a2276793f05e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bfb39d16c076c8945e75de8ba8137d5e424bb7fc959ec8ba423f032b3a6e8c40"
    },
    {
