      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "鳧舞鼓翼，嘉樂堯德。虞夏美功，要荒賓服。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:83033a42c7b4008dc76deb6e0635938d4c6e1f5e77f378b807594f2080466225",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:74a4034ef6cf7191cb081054d6ccaee2859024877e499373086d637ed19698ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "登丘上山，對酒遇歡。終年卒歲，優福無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c38e499f3b236a1e4095cfd0fa73e2bd49ff8f4202eaec23aaef9ac95fcbccf5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0616c71f72676f6daa7c897a11198a9123615719ed2005709b3f5413fc08d1f7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "歲暮花落，陽入陰室。萬物伏匿，藏不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7b9cecb15f58f33d417b376463c349a15d2949778888abdeaa9c3e8fa106a13",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:06f8d6240c16aef00e1c6d37f8459294f465ea597f7db966586b5b1e4094e59b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我禾穀。簞瓶空虛，飢無所食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cdaf93a5353d59d531c429fbc7029227d9ba60e40d1b0f46b4232a3579944641",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8f8ce766ad76a230053e79a475f79688f132678af264d9f55f4a6a2faf821910"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "陽虎脅主，使德不通。炎離為殃，年穀患傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:267c6571367f765a8953d7d8ab411085752e3bc3cc1066b3c3bcdaef19c9eb7a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e2cf520e6dd1dfaa4861fc7b1372cae08c0e478444a59ba66e22df81f5ed50df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "四馬共轅，東上泰山。騂驪同力，無有重難。與君笑言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7cc9f246e310fe11a53272d8dc5f93d1ebe915eb0457a76bf0718dedbfba66eb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7589bb3ca129250ff2b0953a1913938e43184ea68ad804482e98d687228d111"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "牧羊稻園，聞虎喧讙。畏懼悚息，終無禍患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:50a30bb4841ec2b09c78cce441cc5c98995cbbc2626637aec93bea1317b60300",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39f4249f830b65db0cefe70f6572e8bd95dd38846338d5c9b0050fa50f7fa558"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "陽花不時，冬實生危。憂多橫賊，生不能服。崑崙之玉，取求必得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:22743d943665a24da9900ba8c0848379b6c65883f5bdd26543e427ae9be86bdd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fc20853fbf67b45a120b7a21d541ee92f037b54e711eb9f049be53586a420b6e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "高阜所在，陰氣不淋。洪水不處，為家利寶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:668f714e3fb28bc87a51f1dead57b6677e8e40cdc21a92c1f38eab1551a25960",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:983f405ef5363f7fbbb1884cf559937611b6b693978d46267f633525321c3c7f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "釋然遠咎，避患革害。田獲三狐，以貝為寶。君子所在，安寧不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ceb67c692c3386e143510c1d4c07ec653e51e5034733cef02660b0f3793a18e5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e0fef3029755cb60b80e0626ef62e44db143d2d7f513407908cd8a020444c6de"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "兩目失明，日奪無光。脛足跛曳，不可以行。頓於丘旁，亡妾莫逐。嵬然獨宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5d1312ae5bf0e169529ebf834f0fefd43ad613b32f1b0e9bc5d7a3ff38b81ac7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c850cb800fbe69b33beb7f262efe18055130a939a7f185730d5c4e5678abf07f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "鴻飛循陸，公出不復，伯氏客宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aa0e7dbb5007766461a314abc9308f93c6a381342df40cb85c709dceee8d36d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:08e474f88329de1f46c28e4e763ff3c7cc1305cc2d60550494294ee882322d5d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "佩玉纍蕊，無以繫之。孤怨獨處，愁哀相憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b3541c4ab7234d47c37124d0fb251a4f5b548ddafa5e771f0abf4d51725ae234",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2085492c9635b8b4c8649ebe97a40614d6648a825d8331dd23cbf0e190a7b41d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "載船渡海，雖深何咎。孫子俱在，不失其所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e2e3b29b78e323e6e42270f42f650f874ebffb5a9bc4c79009db0cf9cb47eb18",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:56fed4b38721a24935b77f55fe35dfe608d854a8ffd85d780e428b8dd6294b6a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "鵠求魚食，道遇射弋。繒加我頸，繳縛兩翼。欲飛不能，為羿所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:61ba9461dcc68020fa45a5e9ecac703f893aa56a19231dbb3b19d6cd62c70676",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:51b82f513ae614af363d3b767731ffbdfb01d553194a9691f0ea95e5dd9f315e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "泥面亂頭，忍恥少羞，日以削消。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c3b935efd4fefec8ae1404770836ae8001fd516b7112973c5ef1d43c64e023f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9727ebdbedb3cea4158d78f87c6eee4606604917f822902f92cb6b44e13cbf86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "桑方將落，隕其黃葉。失勢傾倒，如無所立。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7de59bc5c6388f50dc5063ff67daf59700860174af17d28aa4d1a6a174fb534a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:05d5612b46f011ca42d469172cedb1bb2418d972a1ea46cd54189451c47b6c42"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "巨蛇大 ，戰於國邦。上下隔塞，主君走逃。巽之臨）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a31f7b5e158bbeed10eaaec4b6e8d84588ea94f83f5126f0500bf3bcd16dfe09",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f732fe0322e3369492a8af98e620d934e9b87f80bbf5d1c935673fa4e3ac932b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "已動死，連商子。揚砂石，胡貉擾。軍鼓振，吏士恐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8d073dd369e1e4a251b35106b55f5a5f2604f40db6b078def013ef52b9f824ec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92ce15a585c66fb99cfb6d43beb0d76dfc01817a849cf36bb12efcdc05c0b265"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "張羅搏鳩，鳥麗其災。雌雄俱得，為網所滅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:205517a73f770c4f54d336e13446ee5eb4b98e07a9d6299629ef50cb6e47d624",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50a6737eae267ff0d85ff0fa1d39686bad186b028077a57d8afe6ac0912e9d8f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "三聖相輔，鳥獸喜舞。安樂富有，二人諧偶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e413891778ad013110d6ee83eeebcbac1819593cecee8fffb651c7ed34149397",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67ed7b192cb67bf8a01aee0df4fe9fec72df794e35e70d96dbdb0ecbd6f6805a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "三奇六耦，相隨俱市。王孫善賈，先得利寶。居止不移，大盜為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:676882f0f7971d1f75bd351682f07de50fded32a01ca7438cb39786851fd6451",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66d05e2a608f3b2739d5d0b5bf931e1f35f16da8433eb8ff59e479d6618e0d47"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "三人俱行，一人言北。伯叔欲南，少叔不得。中路分道，爭鬥相賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02c55989b66a38bc2dfe9761fe424d9c3729c14e9d335b85f7858b5ac98ec5f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1d6f2cb9352fd8b8c712f2ff9d26ea5674da23e243b578601ceebd9737712789"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "播天舞地，擾亂神所。居樂無咎，言不信誤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:14b992f33a17c865d1ac1f9a3d75af7fd540f61117ad747ff39776fc24d1a101",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b585bc59a13e35447ee96f34c170c79cc061d816d1e32f6c6b800c4e6742d1eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "坐爭立訟，紛紛洶洶。幸成禍亂，災及我公。大過之離）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:98c83633aa610c43e840301307188e01586cd3b6c353bcb93bf861cbef458500",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:073bc21b50bae67c5e61f31c599b2d0b7645811e9e72eb33efdc8908ceaf1c1d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "蛇行蜿蜒，不能上阪。履節安居，可以無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40829864808fc2992ae462548f13df5bf7de8ca0e79e6517902ef814304d23a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eda36358d54e662dcfb6c4b8ffe36ecbfb7082169840fcf6dc0f3622710de269"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "隙大牆壞，蠹眾木折。狼虎為政，天降罪伐。高殺望夷，胡亥以斃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:757a6293864b4b42fce3eeffd6610464d2bbe506118e6b67a8edb93de7651842",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fbe3d8aa16d2af1984ce144c091a53f086d141ccb0fa8a8bcbcb46340f67993d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "陽不違德，高山多澤。顏子逐兔，未有所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ad4b2db383d33e673c44b69324e93f2d386c2d71faac9b14e6be4cf05da7f66",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:42fa85ea37c5c10263a4c1f341f58682e5d671ba9887b3053b36796ec21715c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "心多畏惡，時愁日懼。雖有小咎，終無大悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2760e9cf7a01065516eb861b81edea2b1a2446173c2f6f3609723995b11c68b5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ce25fcabebdf7be2638569ecbb82cdb98cb6a15f753115d49bf2464a41f456e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 23,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "眾神集聚，相與議語。南國虐亂，百姓愁苦。舉師征討，別立賢主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:93caf846696ce89b0e4c71f9e3182c4bc1baba6640f0fdd3165923a28e460bc6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e3212afdf08351d65fbd014bc73c8fad8ba79d01cc3e5281db9fab97badac6ff"
    }
  ]
}
